Package: RespiratorySurveillanceWarehouse
Title: Respiratory Virus Surveillance Warehouse and Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rob", "Warren", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R ETL that loads Public Health Agency of Canada respiratory virus
    detection data into a SQL Server star schema, with a Quarto dashboard built
    from the reporting views. Not an installable package; this file declares
    dependencies for CI.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    DBI,
    odbc,
    readr,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    ggplot2,
    scales,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
